    "public_preview": null,
    "text": "Leave a ❤️ below if this spoke to you. \n\nWe lie to ourselves when we say we’re failing at life, when we shame ourselves for being “behind.” In reality, we are responding in a normal way to an increasingly exhausting world. One our nervous systems were not designed to naturally thrive in. \n\nI think a lot of us are carrying more than we even realize right now. Financial pressure. Constant stimulation. Grief. Fear. Isolation. Burnout. Uncertainty about the future. And somehow, we are still expected to function like everything is normal.\n\nSo if you’ve been feeling emotionally tired lately, let this be your reminder that your humanity is not a flaw.\n\nTake care of yourself. Choose yourself, and your community. Stay informed. Stay soft. Stay awake. We need each other more than ever. We really do.\n\nWritten by @williegreene_",
    "word_count": 140
  },
